"This document lists and describes the hardware performance counters and "
"derived metrics available for the AMD Instinct™ MI300 and MI200 GPU. You "
"can also access this information using the :doc:`ROCprofiler-SDK "
"<rocprofiler-sdk:how-to/using-rocprofv3>`."
