"Percentage of GPU time scalar ALU instructions are processed (value "
"range: 0% to 100% (optimal))"
msgstr "スカラーALU命令が処理されるGPU時間の割合（値の範囲：0%～100%（最適））"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid "``SALUInsts``"
msgstr "``SALUInsts``"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid ""
"Average number of scalar ALU instructions run per work item (affected by "
"flow control)"
msgstr ""
"ワークアイテムあたりに実行されるスカラーALU命令の平均数（フロー制御の影響を受"
"ける）"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid "``SFetchInsts``"
msgstr "``SFetchInsts``"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid ""
"Average number of scalar fetch instructions from the video memory run per"
