"Percentage of GPU time vector ALU instructions are processed (value "
"range: 0% to 100% (optimal))"
msgstr "ベクトルALU命令が処理されるGPU時間の割合（値の範囲：0%～100%（最適））"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid "``VALUInsts``"
msgstr "``VALUInsts``"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid ""
"Average number of vector ALU instructions run per work item (affected by "
"flow control)"
msgstr ""
"ワークアイテムあたりに実行されるベクタALU命令の平均数（フロー制御の影響を受け"
"る）"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid "``VALUUtilization``"
msgstr "``VALUUtilization``"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid ""
"Percentage of active vector ALU threads in a wave, where a lower number "
"can mean either more thread divergence in a wave or that the work-group "
"size is not a multiple of 64 (value range: 0%, 100% (optimal - no thread "
"divergence))"
msgstr ""
"波におけるアクティブなベクターALUスレッドの割合。この数値が低い場合、その波に"
"おけるスレッドの分岐が多いか、ワークグループサイズが64の倍数ではないことを意"
"味する（値の範囲：0%、100%（最適値 - スレッドの分岐なし））"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid "``VFetchInsts``"
msgstr "``VFetchInsts``"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi300-mi200-performance-counters.rst:1
msgid ""
"Average number of vector fetch instructions from the video memory run per"
" work-item (affected by flow control); excludes flat instructions that "
