msgstr "飛行中のカウンタの飽和により、UTCL1がすべて停止しました。"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:418
msgid "TCP_UTCL1_STALL_LRU_INFLIGHT"
msgstr "TCP_UTCL1_STALL_LRU_INFLIGHT"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:419
msgid "Total UTCL1 stalls due to LRU cache line with inflight traffic."
msgstr ""
"処理中のトラフィックを含むLRUキャッシュラインが原因で、UTCL1が完全に停止した"
"。"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:421
msgid "TCP_UTCL1_STALL_MULTI_MISS"
msgstr "TCP_UTCL1_STALL_MULTI_MISS"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:422
msgid "Total UTCL1 stalls due to arbitrated multiple misses."
msgstr "アービトレーションによる複数のミスが原因で、UTCL1が完全に停止した。"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:424
msgid "TCP_UTCL1_LFIFO_FULL"
msgstr "TCP_UTCL1_LFIFO_FULL"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:425
