"Number of TCC/EA write requests (32-byte or 64-byte) destined for DRAM "
"(MC)."
msgstr "DRAM（MC）宛てのTCC/EA書き込み要求の数（32バイトまたは64バイト）。"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:502
msgid "TCC_EA0_WRREQ_ATOMIC_DRAM"
msgstr "TCC_EA0_WRREQ_ATOMIC_DRAM"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:503
msgid ""
"Number of TCC/EA atomic requests (32-byte or 64-byte) destined for DRAM "
"(MC)."
msgstr "DRAM（MC）宛てのTCC/EAアトミックリクエスト（32バイトまたは64バイト）の数。"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:505
msgid "TCC_EA0_RDREQ_DRAM_32B"
msgstr "TCC_EA0_RDREQ_DRAM_32B"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:506
