"Number of 32-byte TCC/EA read requests due to DRAM traffic. One 64-byte "
"request is counted as two and one 128-byte as four."
msgstr ""
"DRAMトラフィックによる32バイトのTCC/EA読み出し要求の数。64バイトの要求は2回分"
