#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:508
msgid "TCC_EA0_RDREQ_GMI_32B"
msgstr "TCC_EA0_RDREQ_GMI_32B"

#: ../../conceptual/gpu-arch/mi350-performance-counters.rst:509
msgid ""
"Number of 32-byte TCC/EA read requests due to GMI traffic. One 64-byte "
"request is counted as two and one 128-byte as four."
msgstr ""
"GMIトラフィックによる32バイトのTCC/EA読み取り要求の数。64バイトの要求は2回分"
